      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;디지털 IO 컨트롤러: 출입 및 자동화를 위한 유연한 솔루션 
    &lt;div id=&#34;디지털-io-컨트롤러-출입-및-자동화를-위한-유연한-솔루션&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%eb%94%94%ec%a7%80%ed%84%b8-io-%ec%bb%a8%ed%8a%b8%eb%a1%a4%eb%9f%ac-%ec%b6%9c%ec%9e%85-%eb%b0%8f-%ec%9e%90%eb%8f%99%ed%99%94%eb%a5%bc-%ec%9c%84%ed%95%9c-%ec%9c%a0%ec%97%b0%ed%95%9c-%ec%86%94%eb%a3%a8%ec%85%98&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
